  "description": "Super Mario Bros. follows Mario and Luigi as they race to rescue Princess Toadstool from Bowser, King of the Koopas, who has taken over the Mushroom Kingdom. The brothers run and jump through eight worlds of four levels each, stomping Goombas and Koopa Troopas, breaking bricks and dodging traps on their way to Bowser's castles. The Super Mushroom makes Mario grow, the Fire Flower lets him throw fireballs and the Starman gives him brief invincibility, while hidden blocks, secret bonus areas and warp zones reward exploration. One of the best-selling games of all time, it defined the side-scrolling platformer and helped revive the home video game industry.",
